SUMMARY:Assemblage Lab & Gallery Talk — Unrecyclable: Look Again
DESCRIPTION:Close out Unrecyclable: Look Again with a gallery talk by artist Andrew Borg\, followed by a hands-on Assemblage Lab. Borg walks the exhibition and tells the story behind the work\, then participants build assemblages of their own from unrecyclable plastics and metals\, worn tools\, and “ghost objects” — broken or outmoded technology. Materials provided; bring your own discards too\, the stranger the better. No prior experience required. $10. Register in advance or at the door. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
