SUMMARY:Food Tour and History Walk of Montclair
DESCRIPTION:Explore Montclair\, NJ on this immersive food tour showcasing a hyperlocal culinary hotspot\, co-hosted by Chow Town Food Tours and Montclair History Center. \n“Montclair In Motion” is a social\, flavorful experience rooted in this colorful community’s unique industrial history and more recent cultural growth\, including culinary traditions from Argentina\, the Philippines\, Sicily\, West Africa\, and Brazil. \nChow Town Food Tours and the Montclair History Center will provide expert insights for a tour to remember. This guided exploration of Bloomfield Avenue will lead guests on a leisurely one-mile walk\, stopping for Brazilian comfort food\, humongous cookies\, and more. Meet the chefs and business owners that make this one of the most exciting restaurant scenes in the state. \nDiscover the hidden history behind architecture\, landmarks\, and other notable highlights from the experts at the nonprofit Montclair History Center. \nBring an appetite! The tour will visit several fantastic NJ eateries\, including unapologetic Jersey pizza\, Calabrian-style; international fusion cuisine with a twist from Montclair locals; Brazilian homestyle fare from a lauded cookbook author; a slinger of humongous\, addictive cookies; and more! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/food-tour-and-history-walk-of-montclair/
LOCATION:Crane Park\, Montclair\, NJ
CATEGORIES:Food
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Chow-Town-Food-Tour-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
