DESCRIPTION:Continuing a series of shows at our house venue featuring bands of WFMU Radio DeeJays. Featuring:\nDiscreet Charms (Nate K.)\nhttps://discreetcharms.bandcamp.com/\nVan Goth (Sydney) https://vangothrocks.bandcamp.com/album/is-it\nThe Porchistas (Alan 6)\nhttps://theporchistas.bandcamp.com/\nThe Hoof & Mouth Slimfonia (Scott\, Faye\, Greg from Zone 5\, Sheila B)\nDoors open 3pm. $15 to pay the bands. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
