SUMMARY:8th Annual Jamaica Independence Day Celebration at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Come out and join us and Jamaica Organization of NJ- Essex County Chapter for our 8th Annual Jamaica Independence Day Celebration from 4-10pm! The day is filled with special island-inspired craft drinks\, delicious food available for sale by Taste of the Caribbean\, live music by the supremely talented Platinum One\, rounds of trivia\, and games like Ludi\, Dominoes\, playing cards\, and more out in our Beer Garden for all to enjoy.\nIt’s a day you don’t want to miss out on! Yeah mon!\nPlease note: Both the General Admission and VIP ticket prices will go up starting 12am\, Saturday\, 8/22/26. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
