SUMMARY:Theater League of Clifton presents: The Altos!
DESCRIPTION:The Theater League of Clifton will present “The Altos”\, an interactive dinner theater comic mystery by David Landau\, for three weekends in August 2026. \nPerformances will be held at The Village Inn\, 422 Runnymede Dr\, Wayne\, NJ 07470 on:\nFriday\, August 14\nSaturday\, August 15\nSunday\, August 16 \n…and Mario’s Restaurant & Pizzeria\, 710 Van Houten Ave\, Clifton\, NJ 07013\, on:\nFriday\, August 21\nSaturday\, August 22\nSunday\, August 23\nFriday\, August 28\nSaturday\, August 29\nSunday\, August 30 \nFriday and Saturday performances will begin at 8pm\, with Sunday performances beginning at 4pm. \nMeet the crime family that inspired it all: the Altos! (like ‘The Sopranos’\, only lower!) \nIt is Tony Alto’s funeral—or is it? His wife\, Toffee\, has invited everyone to the wake\, but almost no one seems particularly sorry that Tony is gone. When Tony unexpectedly turns up alive\, his family appears\neven less pleased\, leaving the audience to determine who put a contract out on him. Filled with outrageous characters\, family feuds\, suspicious behavior and plenty of surprises\, “The Altos”\ninvites audience members to become part of the mystery and see whether they can identify the would-be killer. \nThe production is directed by Maren Sugarman and produced by John Traier. The stage manager is JoAnne MacBeth. \nThe cast includes Karen Bednarz\, Stephen Burke\, Felipe Rodriguez\, Sheldon Stone\, and Collin Wehr. \nTickets are priced at $70\, which includes a dinner buffet. Tickets may be reserved at 973-928-7668\, www.theaterleagueofclifton.com\, or by regular mail—payment by check only. The Theater League’s\nmailing address is P.O. Box 4072\, Clifton\, NJ 07012. \nFounded in 2005\, the Theater League of Clifton is a nonprofit community organization dedicated to fostering an appreciation of the arts through theatrical performances while providing quality entertainment\nfor audiences of all ages. \nFor additional information about “The Altos” and other upcoming productions\, visit www.theaterleagueofclifton.com \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/theater-league-of-clifton-presents-the-altos-2/2026-08-22/
LOCATION:Mario’s Restaurant & Pizzeria\, 710 Van Houten Ave\, Clifton\, 07013\, United States
CATEGORIES:Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/TLC-Logo-Bigger-Image-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
