SUMMARY:Montclair Give Back Night
DESCRIPTION:Join the Mia Joy Foundation at Bareburger Montclair on Sunday\, August 23\, for an all-day dine-and-donate event honoring what would have been Mia Joy’s first birthday. \nThe Mia Joy Foundation is a NJ/NY nonprofit that supports families experiencing NICU stays\, stillbirth\, and infant loss through its Grief Concierge and Mia Joy Project programs. \nMention the “Mia Joy Foundation” when placing your dine-in or takeout order\, and Bareburger will donate 20% of your purchase to support the Foundation’s work and its first official NICU donation drive. \nThird-party ordering apps are excluded. To learn more about the Mia Joy Foundation\, visit www.miajoyfoundation.org. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/montclair-give-back-night/
LOCATION:Bareburger\, 480 Bloomfield Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Food
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Picture2.png
ORGANIZER;CN="MIA JOY FOUNDATION":MAILTO:info@miajoyfoundation.org
