SUMMARY:Praise Party
DESCRIPTION:The saints are outsideeee 🕊️✨Join us for a rooftop day party experience filled with gospel music\, community\, joy\, and kingdom vibes overlooking the city skyline. Expect sunshine\, good energy\, fellowship\, and the kind of atmosphere that reminds you faith and fun can exist in the same room. \nWhether you’re coming to dance\, connect\, laugh with friends\, or simply be in a room full of good people — this is your invitation. \n🎶 Sounds by DJ Mar\n🌇 Sunset Views & Kingdom Vibes\n📸 Photo Moments + Rooftop Energy\n🤝 Fellowship • Music • Joy • Community \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
