SUMMARY:Mas Trauma live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Mas Trauma is a 6-piece latin-alt. rock at the intersection between surf rock\, post-punk\, bachata\, metal\, and grunge\, with a songwriting edge that has been frequently described as “theatrical”\, “chaotic”\, “catchy”\, and most importantly\, “weird”. However\, they are also successful at making people dance across a number of Jersey City festivals such as Goatchella\, All About Downtown\, Lucky 7s BBQ. If you leave a Mas Trauma show intrigued\, excited\, and inexplicably scared\, then they’ve done their job. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
