SUMMARY:Flow and Wellness Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Join middle school and high school aged girls for a FREE yoga class! Yoga reduces stress\, builds self-confidence and pampers your body. Healthy activities and coping skills support youth from experimenting with negative activities. Mondays 4pm – 5pm. Faciliated by Anita. Compliments of Essex Health and Wellness\, Montclair Department of Health and the Mayor’s Wellness Campaing. For more information contact Robin rlhealthguide@gmail.com (862) 485-8811 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
