SUMMARY:The C3 Growth Exchange
DESCRIPTION:The C3 Growth Exchange\nClarity\, Strategy & Momentum — In Every Session \nFeeling stuck\, stretched\, or unsure of your next best move? You’re not alone—and you don’t have to figure it out on your own. \nThe C3 Growth Exchange is a free\, high-impact\, one-hour virtual session designed for founders and business leaders who want real progress—not just ideas. Each session blends peer insight with expert facilitation to help you move from uncertainty to action. \nWhat to Expect:\n• Live\, supportive discussion with other growth-minded business owners\n• Practical guidance on your biggest challenges—from strategy to execution\n• Fresh perspective and real-time problem solving\n• Clear next steps you can implement immediately\n• Connection with like-minded professionals \nCome with a challenge. Leave with clarity and momentum. \n– When: 4th Tuesday of every month\n– Time: 12:00 – 1:00 PM (ET)\n– Cost: Free\, Registration Required\, Limited Seating \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
