SUMMARY:Outdoor Yoga Experience
DESCRIPTION:Join Three Birds Yoga Studio on Thursday\, August 27 at 6PM as they celebrate the 5th anniversary of their South Orange location with a special evening of outdoor yoga\, live music\, and community in the heart of downtown. \nThis free\, all-levels yoga class will take place in Village Plaza (20-32 Village Plaza South Orange\, NJ 07079) and be led by Three Birds Yoga Co-Owner Sarah Bodnar\, with music provided by DJ Pap. Following the class\, participants are invited to enjoy complimentary fresh juice from Juice Hub and spend time connecting with fellow attendees. \nWhether you’re a seasoned yogi or trying yoga for the first time\, this welcoming event is open to all experience levels. Advance registration is required. Register here: https://momence.com/Three-Birds-Yoga-Studio/Free-Yoga-on-Village-Plaza/139906199 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
