SUMMARY:Watchung Booksellers Hosts Crime Novelist James Queally
DESCRIPTION:Watchung Booksellers welcomes James Queally\, author of Surviving the Lie\, the third in his Russell Avery series of crime novels. The event will be held in store on Thursday\, August 27 at 7:00 p.m. \nIn Surviving the Lie\, the final installment of this “turnpike noir” crime series\, retired journalist turned private investigator Russell Avery finds himself at odds with a violent band of conspiracy theorists and ex-cops convinced that reporters are the “enemy of the people.” Face-to-face with an America where facts are more fluid than Newark’s Passaic River\, he must decide if the truth is still worth fighting for. \nIn addition to authoring the Russell Avery series\, James Queally is a Pulitzer prize-winning criminal justice reporter for the Los Angeles Times and has covered crime and police news for the Star-Ledger in New Jersey. \nTickets are $5 and include a 10% discount on the book purchased at the event. For more information and to purchase\, visit watchungbooksellers.com. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/watchung-booksellers-hosts-crime-novelist-james-queally/
LOCATION:Watchung Booksellers\, 54 Fairfield Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 97042\, United States
