SUMMARY:Bobby Jo Valentine Concert at Union Congregational Church
DESCRIPTION:On Thursday\, August 27 at 7:00 PM\, Union Congregational Church will host Bobby Jo Valentine\, a queer\, progressive\, faith-based folk singer-songwriter\, for an evening of music and stories.\nA longtime friend of the United Church of Christ\, Bobby Jo describes himself as an “explorative\, hopeful\, spiritual\, queer artist who strives to make music and poetry that is good medicine for everyone.” He has performed at UCC General Synod and at churches and communities across the country\, won multiple awards for his songwriting\, and given a TEDx Talk. At the heart of his work is a belief in the soft and steady power of everyday acts of love to heal our world. This concert is an extension of Union Congregational Church’s Open and Affirming commitment; everyone is welcome. \nEvent: Bobby Jo Valentine in Concert\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\nTime: 7:00 PM\nLocation: Union Congregational Church\, 176 Cooper Ave.\, Montclair\, NJ\nTickets: Sliding scale\, $10–$30 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/bobby-jo-valentine-concert-at-union-congregational-church/
LOCATION:Union Congregational Church\, 176 Cooper Avenue\, Montclair NJ\, 176 Cooper Avenue\, Montclair\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Bobby-Jo-Valentine-1.png
