SUMMARY:Rhythm & Riddim
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the second installment of Rhythm & Riddim\, where Caribbean vibes\, breathtaking views and beautiful people come together under the stars for another unforgettable night! \nHosted by Jam+Rico\, this rooftop fête brings together great music\, vibrant energy\, and a stylish crowd for an evening inspired by the warmth and spirit of the Caribbean. Dance the night away to vibes curated by DJ BRUCKI\, enjoy signature cocktails & light bites\, and soak in the skyline from the stunning rooftop at the MC Hotel. \nWhether you’re coming to celebrate\, connect\, or simply enjoy a perfect summer night\, Rhythm & Riddim is your destination for good music\, good people\, and unforgettable memories. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
